   "t": "Having secretly replaced the missing live goose with a dressed market carcass, Max returns to face head chef Viktor Barinov. Barinov immediately questions why Max's apron is spotless without a single drop of blood, forcing Max to tell a shocking lie. Let's listen to their confrontation in Russian first.",
